{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "07T2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$F : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$1$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$F$", "MATH_0006": "$F$", "MATH_0007": "$F$", "MATH_0008": "$k$", "MATH_0009": "$S$", "MATH_0010": "$x_0$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$k$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{criteria-section-formally-smooth}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{equation-functoriality}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{formal-defos-definition-smooth-morphism}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-formally-smooth-on-deformation-categories}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2133a23183484af15b3c4da4dad9a940b756d184603e07013c1f2102ee6e290c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4c7459c3a100d0fa8f12e78358210a00d8e2105705d1fd4e1feee564cd146819", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a <MATH_0003>-morphism of categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0004>.\nAssume either\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005> is formally smooth on objects (Criteria for Representability,\nSection <REF_0001>),\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0006> is representable by algebraic spaces and formally smooth, or\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0007> is representable by algebraic spaces and smooth.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nThen for every finite type field <MATH_0008> over <MATH_0009> and object\n<MATH_0010> of <MATH_0011> over <MATH_0012> the functor (<REF_0002>)\nis smooth in the sense of\nFormal Deformation Theory, Definition\n<REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9977f435a1e1b040d46d3ec6051a3353c9f513f7c3ba6239e2769ee8558bbd0a", "unit_id": "tag:07WK:statement"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "07T2", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{criteria-lemma-representable-by-spaces-formally-smooth}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-more-morphisms-lemma-smooth-formally-smooth}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebraic-lemma-representable-transformations-property-implication}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cc194654112ed767b880adbaa0d8ae7e30dc86c6e71e1ad027683a1fa123d51f", "source_text": "Case (1) is a matter of unwinding the definitions.\nAssumption (2) implies (1) by\nCriteria for Representability, Lemma\n<REF_0001>.\nAssumption (3) implies (2) by\nMore on Morphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0002>\nand the principle of\nAlgebraic Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:07249e0b3779b38930414655eb863accf9a97d16d0609d7a9f88eb358b1f1565", "unit_id": "tag:07WK:proof"}
